// Mission metadata. The actual audio clips (hundreds to thousands per
// mission, spanning launch to splashdown, with full synced transcripts)
// live in src/data/clips/<id>.json (clip index) and
// public/transcripts/<id>.json (per-clip transcript lines) — generated by
// scripts/scrape.py from the Apollo Flight Journal and Apollo Lunar Surface
// Journal (apollojournals.org), a volunteer archive of public-domain NASA
// mission recordings. Re-run that script to refresh or add a mission.

